{"actor_ref":"claude","class":"draft_history","document_uuid":"01a1a54a-31a4-70ff-ba8f-d428b8df4743","id":"01a1a630-8140-74ac-bd25-b96456fa3fc9","idempotency_key":"1163444025838242856fa8d67d16988b9dcc19621229e78ee3e2f3304c1de0f7","occurred_at":"2026-11-04T10:52:39Z","payload":{"episode":0,"item":"i-a95a","note":"The persistent queue, pause/resume/step and concurrency limits are in Running (crates/ai/src/tournament.rs): next_batch returns ready pairings up to a concurrency limit (default 1 for local models, 2 when any competitor is hosted), pause stops new games while games in flight still finish, resume continues from the stored state, a hard token/cost budget pauses at the cap, and the whole thing round-trips through schema v8 so a restart resumes exactly where it stopped (asserted by running_survives_a_restart_exactly_as_it_was and running_a_pause_survives_a_restart).","on":"2026-11-04","target":"t-a98f/i-a95a"},"type":"work.item_done","v":2}
